                                                "sense_id": "06720f95-4046-32ad-83cb-86a653f977da",
                                                "text": "[…] in improving the transfer function of these proxy data and in modelling the response of the climate system to the astronomical forcing over the last 3 Ma with a particular attention paid to the phase relations between insolation,[…]"
                                            },
