                                                "sense_id": "06720f95-4046-32ad-83cb-86a653f977da",
                                                "text": "[…] the 100,000-yr periodicity observed in climate fluctuations may result from the combined effect of a weak (deterministic) astronomic forcing and background environmental noise in a complex, nonlinear system with internal feedbacks."
